# Chapter 2: Predicating

Predicating turns a potential articulation cell into an oriented predication
position. This is where subject, predicate, and object become lawful words.

The predication cell is a position, not a truth. It names where a value may later
live. Keeping cell identity separate from valuation is one of the main ways Obsmetrologia
avoids collapsing into ordinary two-valued assertion logic.

## Predication without truth

The predication cell carries orientation. It can say that there is a position from
subject through predicate to object. It does not yet say that the position is true,
false, supported, contradicted, settled, or coherent.

This separation is foundational. If value were baked into the predication cell, the
identity of a relation would change whenever evidence changed. Obsmetrologia instead
keeps the cell as a place and lets positing assign standing to that place.

## The recovery of category

Category-theoretic structure first becomes available here because predication has
generated oriented cells and lawful transformations among them. In this program,
category theory is not the language in which predication is primitively encoded.
It is one of the structures recovered once predication has produced the right kind
of object.

This is one of the manual's most important explanatory burdens. A reader trained in
categorical foundations will want to start with category. Obsmetrologia asks them to wait
until category has been generated.

## The closure this chapter asks for

The reader must learn to see a predication as a site of possible valuation rather
than as an already-valued assertion. The chapter's gutter runs from articulation
status to oriented position. Once that gutter is crossed, categorical language can
enter honestly: not as an ambient metalanguage, but as a recovered discipline of
oriented cells and their lawful transformations.

The repair locator for this chapter is the split between cell and value. If later
prose starts treating predication as truth, return here. The missing step is
positing.
